# Demo-heavy UI (supply-chain-demo)

- Prefer changes a reviewer can see: charts, tables, filters, pivots, and dashboard labels.
- Use existing Recharts paths (Business Insights, admin Store Dashboard, warehouse stock summary).
- Prefer graphs and pivots over mocked AI/ML.
- Keep the app runnable after every change. Do not add Grafana or extra observability stacks.
- Minimize new dependencies. Do not wire Stripe or Shippo unless the task needs payment or shipping.
- After catalog / order / stock writes, use the existing TanStack invalidation helpers.
